doc:sch-2-sec-1-ss-2d a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "1(2D) Subsections 6(2A) and (2B)" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2D) If the Minister makes a declaration under subsection (2B), the Minister must, by legislative instrument, specify:  (a) the name of the force or service operating the premises to which the declaration relates; and  (b) the geographical region in which those premises are located.  Schedule 2  Amendment of the Telecommunications (Interception) Act 1979" ;
