concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-telecommunications-interception-and-other-measures-act-2005-sch-2-sec-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "2 After paragraph 103(ac)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-2 ;
    values:originalText "Insert:  (ad) for each State and for the Australian Capital Territory, the number and type of emergency service facilities located in that State or Territory that have been declared by the Minister during the year to which the report relates; and  Amendment of the Telecommunications (Interception) Act 1979  Schedule 2 Interception by radiocommunications inspectors  Part 2  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Telecommunications Interception and Other Measures) Act 2005 No. 95, 2005            7" ;
    skos:definition "Insert:  (ad) for each State and for the Australian Capital Territory, the number and type of emergency service facilities located in that State or Territory that have been declared by the Minister during the year to which the report relates; and  Amendment of the Telecommunications (Interception) Act 1979  Schedule 2 Interception by radiocommunications inspectors  Part 2  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Telecommunications Interception and Other Measures) Act 2005 No. 95, 2005            7"@en ;
