doc:sch-2-sec-15 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "15 After subsection 5(4)" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "Insert:  (4A) A reference in this Act to an employee of a carrier includes a reference to a person who is engaged by the carrier or whose services are made available to the carrier.  [Minister’s second reading speech made in— Senate on 16 March 2005 House of Representatives on 23 June 2005]  (38/05)" ;
